    "text": "Launch your own vertical micro-drama app for short stories, premium episodes & smooth mobile viewing.\n\nHi Jishnu\n\nDid you know?\n\nUsers across the globe now spend an average of 2 hours daily watching short-form vertical content on microdrama apps.\n\nPeople no longer want:\n\n❌ Long movies\n\n❌ Slow-paced web series\n\n❌ Endless binge watching\n\nNow audiences want:\n\n✅ 30-second to 2-minute episodes\n\n✅ Fast emotional storytelling\n\n✅ Vertical mobile-first experiences\n\nMicrodrama apps like ReelShort, DramaBox and ShortMax are already generating multi-million-dollar revenues via subscriptions, coin-based and pay-per-episode models.\n\nStill thinking?\n\nWith VPlayed, you can launch your own white-label microdrama streaming app with vertical video experiences, coin-based monetization and AI-powered content recommendations.\n\nGet multi-device OTT accessibility along with complete source-code and platform ownership.\n\nHere is a quick read on how content owners are building and monetizing content with microdrama apps 👉 Microdrama App Development Guide (https://stories.contus.com/e3t/Ctc/OL+113/c3Ytt04/VW9sh32s59VvW1njdxt3lL5mrW69sl4k5PhyFCN67vcnP3l5QzW7lCdLW6lZ3q0W2svtD13Sn3NFW29L_WT4HtN-WW6gyVQx6G-lPlW2chTYb18dxQ2W9kDJ2n2v3Pv4W6wxf5t8-byftW5dW27n5_d-p8W1Bf5Cc3h-hmVVHS65r8rK-7pN3YTZXxtwz2FW1n9tNm7MH023W7wBYkD4d5X53W3pcMtg32SNwDW3Tpggk3CMWp5VNjnR02fyr3rW6w_y4t61nyc5W6mfKQh4Jy3B1VlSHzf8lR0XtW1Dbfkb6SN6scW6VBh-h8Cg0SDW1vQGyG4qGhlcW3kpZ678fGpfPW60_VBJ6gNrv7VHg0ZT7r0rFNf4Y6MF404 )\n\nWant to build your own microdrama streaming app? Request a Demo (https://stories.contus.com/e3t/Ctc/OL+113/c3Ytt04/VW9sh32s59VvW1njdxt3lL5mrW69sl4k5PhyFCN67vcnv3l5QzW6N1vHY6lZ3lDW4-X2P5911WbJVZ5xGG1kb6s-W8jBDH63-jSFjW1F4vYX44zkPSW3FSj1_1lWP9tN6y6sg1wRLRsW32WPv04j8HCYW6CrLNR2ys3SsVh1sCP90d2jzW1G3fgm8DLVRPW6sG6C24qTnHpN8lJGrxWT215W2Fxg-d8-n-dhV5-ZW88vq8jCW2sk5wC2vrXr2W7Wv3Zl8Rk_Z3W426ccc2Fkc9CW861Gfs5hztscW6p5W402h7H5sW5nM1YF4qXslDW2xmdyP3fyQBjW693bSF349kpnf8W7D6W04 )\n\nW